docs/adr/0325-the-release-record-turns-the-shipped-migration-checks-on.md	Status: accepted · 2026-11-03. A PM decision, taken on the owner's behalf. It changes the mechanism of ADRs 322 and 323 only. The owner decisions of those ADRs do not change
docs/adr/0325-the-release-record-turns-the-shipped-migration-checks-on.md	path. Architecture review round 9 found this (issue #2335). The owner said
docs/adr/0326-split-the-hot-files-by-area-in-small-steps.md	(owner).**
docs/adr/0326-split-the-hot-files-by-area-in-small-steps.md	2. **`e2e/coverage.go` splits into one file for each area (owner).** Each
