docs/adr/0326-split-the-hot-files-by-area-in-small-steps.md	5. **`pkg/dustpan/dustpan.go` splits in the smaller form (owner).** The
docs/adr/0326-split-the-hot-files-by-area-in-small-steps.md	6. **These files do not split (owner):** `GLOSSARY.md`, the API description,
