docs/rfc/0010-artifact-registry-and-curated-upstreams.md	| Which scanners | **Owner decision D3.** Recommended: no scanner in the server. A runner job of the kind `package-scan` runs a scanner image of the team, for example `govulncheck -mode=binary` or OSV-Scanner. It uploads a report in the model of RFC 90. The fact group `scan` of `package.admit` reads it. Option 2: a scanner in the server. It adds a tool, its database and its network access to the server. Option 3: no scanning in Milestone 6. |
